      "statusChangeNewStatus": "tracked",
      "value": "I see this but I'm not sure that we'd want to change it, this is a pretty complex behaviour that's implemented on Unity's side. There are cases where you may want to change the selection on right-click, and cases where you might not. We can call out that right-click mostly works on selected nodes, so make sure you've selected what you want to modify first.",
      "viewerReactions": null
